        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 \(viewBox.width) \(viewBox.height)">\
        <path fill="\(capColor)" d="\(capShape)"/>\
        <path fill="\(ink.rawValue)" d="\(faceShape)"/>\
        </svg>
        """
